re_item_assets/steam/apps/863490/extras/2f426f6e4928058eb0b8289859ca57fc.poster.avif?t=1762272972\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/863490/extras/2f426f6e4928058eb0b8289859ca57fc.webm?t=1762272972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/863490/extras/2f426f6e4928058eb0b8289859ca57fc.mp4?t=1762272972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Great to play both with joystick or keyboard.<br></li><li>Oldschool pixel art graphics.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack.</li></ul>",
